</address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>JUNEJA LEKH RAJ</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKUBO TSUTOMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHU SEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIHARA, NORIYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>JUNEJA, LEKH, RAJ</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKUBO, TSUTOMU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHU, SEIJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A poultry producibility improver containing a polymannose having such a molecular weight distribution that the molecular weights ranging from 1.8x10&lt;3&gt; to 1.8x10&lt;5&gt; account for 70 % or above; a pultry producibility improver further containing a polyphenol; a poultry producibility improver furthermore containing defatted rice bran; and a method of improving the producibility of laying hen or chicken breed by using any of the above improvers. The invention permits the poultry producibility to be improved at a low cost.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un agent améliorant la productibilité de volailles contenant un polymannose ayant une telle répartition de masse moléculaire que les masses moléculaires allant de 1,8 x 10&lt;3&gt; à 1,8 x 10&lt;5&gt; représentent 70 % ou davantage; un agent améliorant la productibilité de volailles contenant également un polyphénol, un agent améliorant la productibilité de volailles contenant également du son de riz dégraissé, et un procédé d'amélioration de la productibilité de pondeuses ou de races de poulets par l'utilisation de n'importe lequel des agents améliorant précités. L'invention permet d'améliorer à faible coût la productibilité de volailles.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>